1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,232
If Earth stopped,

2
00:00:01,233 --> 00:00:02,566
you’d keep moving east—

3
00:00:02,567 --> 00:00:03,432
about a thousand

4
00:00:03,433 --> 00:00:04,066
miles an hour

5
00:00:04,067 --> 00:00:05,133
at the equator.

6
00:00:05,167 --> 00:00:07,033
Loose objects keep going too.

7
00:00:07,067 --> 00:00:08,400
So does the air.

8
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,300
And the ocean.

9
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,066
You don’t feel the spin

10
00:00:14,067 --> 00:00:15,967
because you move with Earth.

11
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,566
Closer to the poles,

12
00:00:17,567 --> 00:00:19,567
that starting speed is lower.

13
00:00:19,767 --> 00:00:21,532
The stop is imaginary.

14
00:00:21,533 --> 00:00:23,300
The motion is real.

